<view class="page"><view class="title">消费凭证盒</view><view class="hint">主动上传材料，不自动读取支付宝交易。PNG/JPG/WebP，最大 10MB。</view><view class="error">{{error}}</view><button onTap="upload" loading="{{busy}}">选择截图上传</button><textarea value="{{text}}" onInput="input" placeholder="粘贴原始回复文字"/><button onTap="addText">保存文字材料</button><view class="card" a:for="{{record.evidence}}" key="id"><view>{{item.code}} · {{item.filename}}</view><view class="quote">{{item.sourceText}}</view><view class="hint">{{item.confirmed?'已核对':'待核对'}} · SHA256 {{item.sha256}}</view><view class="quote">{{item.extraction.merchant}} {{item.extraction.amount}} {{item.extraction.date}} {{item.extraction.product}} {{item.extraction.orderNumber}} {{item.extraction.refundStatus}}</view><button a:if="{{item.sourceType==='text'}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" onTap="confirm">核对文字并确认字段</button><view class="hint" a:else>图片请在 Web 打开原件，核对字段后确认。</view></view></view>
